  "observations": [
    "retrieval metadata and payload have distinct identity; source label is outside the reference hash",
    "get checks response-content digest; portable metadata verification and authorization are not established by that check",
    "manifest replay and unpinned latest request lookup are distinct",
    "Card.explain retrieval lineage basis is source_in_build, not exact response-to-field support",
    "retention report is derived at read time; record has no metadata-only non-retention branch",
    "only BindingDB is registered as a mirror adapter; release ZIP uses MD5 verification and own downloaded ZIP is removed after indexing",
    "SQLite sessions and per-instance thread lock do not qualify shared multi-process or distributed operation",
    "auto/keep mirror cleanup does not account for project pin dependencies"
  ],
